Error [E0112]: `pair` wants Int (a whole number) for argument 1, but this is String (text)
  --> tests/ui/call_mapping_type_boundary.jet:7:10
    |
  7 |     pair("wrong", 1)
    |          ^^^^^^^
 Why: every argument must match its parameter's type
 Fix: use Int (a whole number) here
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112

